graph TB
    subgraph VllmGaudi["vllm-gaudi Plugin"]
        direction TB
        Platform["HpuPlatform<br/>(Platform Abstraction)"]
        Worker["HPUWorker<br/>(v1 Worker)"]
        Runner["HPUModelRunner<br/>(Model Runner)"]
        Extension["extension<br/>(Runtime Config)"]
        Ops["ops<br/>(Custom Operations)"]

        Platform -->|configures| Worker
        Platform -->|selects backends| Runner
        Extension -->|feature flags| Platform
        Runner -->|uses| Ops
        Worker -->|delegates| Runner
    end

    subgraph EntryPoints["Python Entry Points"]
        PlatformPlugin["vllm.platform_plugins<br/>(hpu)"]
        GeneralPlugin["vllm.general_plugins<br/>(utils, ops, models)"]
    end

    VllmEngine["vLLM Engine<br/>(Upstream)"] -->|loads via| PlatformPlugin
    VllmEngine -->|loads via| GeneralPlugin
    PlatformPlugin -->|registers| Platform
    GeneralPlugin -->|registers| Ops

    Client["Client<br/>(via Platform Ingress)"] -->|POST /v1/*| APIServer["vLLM OpenAI API Server<br/>Port 8000/TCP"]
    APIServer -->|dispatches| VllmEngine
    VllmEngine -->|inference| Worker
    Worker -->|executes on| HPU["Intel Gaudi HPU<br/>(SynapseAI 1.23.0)"]

    ModelStorage["Model Storage<br/>(S3/PVC/HF Hub)"] -->|model weights| VllmEngine

    subgraph OptionalNIXL["Optional: Disaggregated Inference"]
        NIXL["NIXL Transport<br/>(KV Cache Transfer)"]
    end
    Worker -.->|KV cache| NIXL

    style Platform fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Worker fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Runner fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Extension fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Ops fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style APIServer fill:#f5a623,color:#fff
    style HPU fill:#9b59b6,color:#fff
    style VllmEngine fill:#e8e8e8,color:#333
    style ModelStorage fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style NIXL fill:#95a5a6,color:#fff
    style Client fill:#f9f9f9,color:#333
